      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EAn Entrayle.\u003C/b\u003E Take a chepis wombe; take polettys y-rostyd, \u0026 hew them; then take porke, chese, \u0026 spicery, \u0026 do it on a morter, \u0026 grind alle y-fere; then take it up with eggs y-swonge, \u0026 do in the wombe, \u0026 salt, \u0026 seethe them tyl he be y-nowe, \u0026 serve forth.\u003Cbr\u003E"
